  "prefLabel": "Cub 203.05 Media Access",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 203.05 Media Access.\n\n(a) Rulemaking hearings shall be open to the print and electronic media;\n\n(b) The placement of television cameras shall have specific locations in the room where the board meeting is being held; and\n\n(c) Interviews shall not be conducted within the room where the board meeting is being held during the board meeting.\n\nSource. #8570-A, eff 2-18-06; ss by #10005, eff 9-22-11",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cub100-300.html"
